  "decisionSummary": "Mechanical integration fix (R-55): textProvider registry now derives from TEXT_MODEL_IDS (authoritative list in src/types/textModels.ts) instead of hardcoding model IDs, with a completeness guard so every TextModelId resolves to a provider. No model ID, prompt, parameter, reference-image, billing, or evaluation semantics change; the text node still uses the reviewed OpenAI-compatible POST /v1/chat/completions contract.",
